{
    "id": "5jwoj.berich.loon",
    "name": "BeRich Loon 合集",
    "description": "Loon 专用订阅合集，包含京东Cookie同步等插件的配置管理",
    "author": "@5jwoj",
    "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/loon.png",
    "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich",
    "apps": [
        {
            "id": "jd.cookie.sync.loon",
            "name": "京东Cookie同步 (Loon)",
            "keys": [
                "jd_ql_url",
                "jd_ql_client_id",
                "jd_ql_client_secret"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/JDCK",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">Loon 版 · 自动捕获京东 Cookie 并同步到青龙面板</h4>",
                "<p>每次打开京东 APP，Loon 自动拦截请求并提取 <code>pt_key / pt_pin</code>，直接同步至青龙面板的 <code>JD_COOKIE</code> 环境变量（遵循 QuanX 静默同步与变动通知规则）。</p>",
                "<hr>",
                "<p><b>使用步骤：</b></p>",
                "<ol><li>在 Loon 中安装插件：<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Sync_Loon.plugin\">JD_Cookie_Sync_Loon.plugin</a></li><li>在下方填写青龙面板信息并保存</li><li>确保 Loon 开启 MitM 并已信任证书</li><li>打开京东 APP 浏览任意页面即可自动触发同步</li></ol>",
                "<p align=\"center\">使用说明请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/blob/main/JDCK/README_Loon.md\">README_Loon.md</a></p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号（例如 http://192.168.1.1:5700）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 → 系统设置 → 应用设置中创建应用获取"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 → 系统设置 → 应用设置中创建应用获取（权限需勾选环境变量）"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Sync_Loon.js"
        }
    ]
}
